{'symbol': 'RMD', 'date': '2019-10-23 22:30:00', 'title': 'RESMED INC. DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND FOR THE PERIOD ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2019, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 12, 2019', 'text': 'RESMED INC. ANNOUNCED THAT BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF USD 0.03900000 PER SHARE FOR THE PERIOD ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2019. THE DIVIDEND WILL HAVE A RECORD DATE OF NOVEMBER 7, 2019, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 12, 2019. EX-DATE IS NOVEMBER 6, 2019.'}